{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Micronutrient Radar Data"},"description":"Daily averages of 31 essential vitamins, minerals and amino acids, each set against a general adult reference intake, shaped for a radar chart. Reads the live diary by default (up to 14 days ending at end_date, default today), or a downloaded export when `folder` is given (up to 31 days). Averages divide by days that have food logged, listed in `daysLogged`. A spoke where any food entry lacked the nutrient is `incomplete` and carries only an at-least floor. Amino-acid references scale with body weight, so pass body_weight_kg or they have none. References are population figures, not personal targets; this reports logged intake and does not diagnose deficiencies.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"body_weight_kg":{"description":"Body weight in kilograms, for the per-kg amino-acid references. Convert pounds first (\u00d7 0.45359237).","maximum":400,"minimum":20,"type":"number"},"days":{"default":7,"description":"How many days, ending at end_date, to average. Live reads cover at most 14.","maximum":31,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"end_date":{"description":"Last day to include. Defaults to today (live) or the export\u2019s last day.","type":"string"},"folder":{"description":"A downloaded export folder from list_exports. Omit to read the live diary.","maxLength":64,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*$","type":"string"},"profile":{"default":"adult-male","description":"Which adult reference intakes (ages 31\u201350) to compare against.","enum":["adult-male","adult-female"],"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"nutrient_radar","outputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"data":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bodyWeightKg":{"anyOf":[{"exc